flowchart LR
  A[Canonical axiology O_A^v] --> C[Compiler C_phi]
  C --> M[Derived module A_phi^v]
  N[Normative sources + Conflict state] --> R[Runtime resolver]
  D[Domain ontology O_D] --> R
  P[Purpose model P] --> R
  W[World state W_t<br/>source + confidence] --> R
  M --> T[Transformer computation<br/>representation + attention + routing]
  R --> T
  T --> X[Structured candidate action]
  X --> V[Independent fixed verifier]
  V --> Y[Execute if permitted<br/>reconsider / escalate otherwise]
